  "output": "All tests pass now.\n\n**Root cause:** The bug was in `parser.py`, not in `processor.py` (which is where the traceback pointed). `parse_csv_line()` split lines on `\";\"`, but the CSV data in the tests uses `\",\"` as the delimiter. So `sum_column` received the entire line (e.g. `\"1,2,3\"`) as a single field, causing an `IndexError` and a `ValueError`.\n\n**Fix:** Changed `parse_csv_line` in `parser.py` to split on `\",\"` instead of `\";\"`.\n\nResult: `2 passed`.",
